{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 16px 14px 22px; background-color: #f9f6f0; background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,\u0026#34;); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 140px 140px; color: #2b2d30; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); border: 1px solid #e5ddd2; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 15px 22px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #faf6f0; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #6085a8\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #39434d; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0\"\u003e陶土橙、雾霾蓝与暖黄碎石散落在水磨石外框上，托起一张清爽松弛的纯白画报卡片。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; background-color: #fbf8f3; border: 1px solid #e6ddd1; border-radius: 12px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/creative-studio.jpg\" alt=\"色彩色卡、素描本与陶瓷杯的创意工作台俯拍\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #d4704e; color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #27292c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e双色交替让图文更有律动\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #2b2d30; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e外圈水磨石彩粒平铺奠定摩登审美，正文章节自动在陶土橙与雾蓝间切换，轻快不呆板。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #f3f7fa; border-left: 4px solid #5f87ab; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #354d63; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.88; margin: 0\"\u003e好设计就像水磨石里的彩粒，各自鲜明，合在一起却格外和谐。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #5f87ab; color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e02\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #27292c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e摩登生活刊的视觉层次\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 14px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: #2b2d30; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e外框彩色水磨石肌理 + 内层纯白可读卡片\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e奇偶章节自动切换陶土橙 / 雾霾蓝\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e柔和雾蓝左线引语块平衡暖色调\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #faf6f0; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #6d645b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; text-align: center\"\u003e把喜欢的颜色和器物搬进日常，生活自然明亮起来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
